## Import

Import existing resource

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_connector.example-connector
  id = "connector-name"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_connector.example-connector connector-name
```

